{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485770/extras/SmartJumpPad.gif?t=1744665680\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Isolated and stranded in the middle of the ocean, Tom participates in a trivia quiz to try to win a prestigious trophy, the\u00a0<strong>Golden Brain</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">General Knowledge Quiz</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You need to answer 555 multiple-choice questions on various themes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If your answer is correct, you move on to the next question.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If your answer is wrong, you fall into the water.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is a checkpoint for each question.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Interface</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The green counter displays your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The red counter shows how many times you have fallen into the water.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A timer records your time. Hurry up!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Goal</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All players who finish the game win a trophy, the <strong>Golden Brain</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete the game with a high score, a good time, and few falls into the water.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Day/night cycle</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Between sea and mountains, a blue sky during the day.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At night, the sky is filled with stars and auroras.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Automatic save</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your progress is saved automatically at regular intervals.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Note from the developer</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The difficulty of the quiz is subjective, depending on each player's knowledge. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I\u2019ve put a lot of effort into finding the right balance (hello, I\u2019m Scratch), ensuring the questions are neither too easy nor too difficult. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">My goal was to make the challenge fun and fair for everyone. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I hope you enjoy the game. Good luck!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3485770?t=1744665680","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3485770?t=1744665680","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485770/2a8154fb041955823917c78c5ae74ef7fe3a9c02/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744665680","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485770/2a8154fb041955823917c78c5ae74ef7fe3a9c02/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744665680","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485770/extras/SmartJumpPad.gif?t=1744665680\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Isolated and stranded in the middle of the ocean, Tom participates in a trivia quiz to try to win a prestigious trophy, the\u00a0<strong>Golden Brain</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">General Knowledge Quiz</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You need to answer 555 multiple-choice questions on various themes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If your answer is correct, you move on to the next question.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If your answer is wrong, you fall into the water.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is a checkpoint for each question.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Interface</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The green counter displays your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The red counter shows how many times you have fallen into the water.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A timer records your time. Hurry up!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Goal</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All players who finish the game win a trophy, the <strong>Golden Brain</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete the game with a high score, a good time, and few falls into the water.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Day/night cycle</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Between sea and mountains, a blue sky during the day.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At night, the sky is filled with stars and auroras.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Automatic save</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your progress is saved automatically at regular intervals.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Note from the developer</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The difficulty of the quiz is subjective, depending on each player's knowledge. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I\u2019ve put a lot of effort into finding the right balance (hello, I\u2019m Scratch), ensuring the questions are neither too easy nor too difficult. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">My goal was to make the challenge fun and fair for everyone. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I hope you enjoy the game. Good luck!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["scratch"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485770/header.jpg?t=174466